[7/8] Laying out methods...   [***]                                                         (9.1s @ 2.81GB)
[8/8] Creating image...       [***]                                                         (8.8s @ 2.34GB)
  39.70MB (51.38%) for code area:    52,268 compilation units
  37.11MB (48.02%) for image heap:  386,406 objects and 365 resources
